  "title": "Quick Gooey Indian Cauliflower Aloo Gobi",
  "description": "A salty and gooey Indian dish featuring sweetened condensed milk, deep-fry-tod, and cauliflower, perfect for the monsoon season. This keto-friendly recipe is a twist on the classic aloo gobi.",
