  "instructions": [
    "Heat the ghee in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the cumin seeds and let them sizzle for a few seconds.",
    "Add the diced aloo and cook until they are golden brown.",
    "Add the cauliflower florets and cook until they are tender.",
    "Add the coriander powder, turmeric powder, and red chili powder, and stir well.",
    "Pour in the sweetened condensed milk and stir until the mixture is gooey and well combined.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh cilantro and serve hot."
